  "description": "*“Ajusshi, you touched me earlier, didn’t you? In that case, I’m going to touch you back.”*  \n\n*“Get out. And stop disrupting my business.”*\n\nChoi Nan-young, a college student, fell in love at first sight with Tae Seung-min, a \"gangster\" who saved him from a part-time job scam.  \n\nA few years later, Nanyeong reappears before Seungmin, now the owner of the flower shop *Garden Flora*, as a headstrong part-time employee.\n\nContrary to the firm words Seung-min uses to draw a clear boundary, the hands he uses to push Nan-young away seem to linger just a little too long.\n\nHowever, a shadow from Seung-min’s past, Mi Seok-woo, begins to reach out toward Nan-young.\n\n*“I could give you so much more… than that guy ever could.”*\n\nThe scent of blood, hidden beneath the fragrance of flowers.\nA tenacious unrequited love that only digs deeper the more it's pushed away.\n\nWill Seung-min be able to put up with Nan-young to the very end?\n\n----\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/gardenflora), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/gardenflora), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5413000001)  \nR15: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/gardenflora_), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/gardenflora_15), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5413000002)",
